msgstr "[.filename]#doc/shared/contrib-committers.adoc# - 添加一条记录，之后会显示在 extref:{contributors}[贡献者列表, staff-committers] 的“开发者”部分。记录按姓氏排序。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:2198
#, fuzzy
