msgstr "action \"freebsd\" relay host smtp+tls://freebsd@smtp.freebsd.org:587 auth <secrets>\nmatch from any auth yourlocalusername mail-from \"_yourusername_@freebsd.org\" for any action \"freebsd\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:2359
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Where _yourlocalusername_ is the SASL username used to connect to the local "
"instance of OpenSMTPD."
