#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:2361
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Create [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/mail/secrets# with the following content:"
msgstr "创建 [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/mail/secrets#，并写入以下内容："

#. type: delimited block . 4
