#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3838
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Benefits and Perks for FreeBSD Committers"
msgstr "FreeBSD 提交者的福利与待遇"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3841
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Recognition"
msgstr "认可"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3845
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Recognition as a competent software engineer is the longest lasting value.  "
"In addition, getting a chance to work with some of the best people that "
"every engineer would dream of meeting is a great perk!"
msgstr "获得作为合格软件工程师的认可，是最持久的价值。此外，有机会与每位工程师都梦想结识的优秀人士共事，也是很棒的福利！"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3847
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`Gandi.net`"
msgstr "`Gandi.net`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3850
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"https://gandi.net[Gandi] provides website hosting, cloud computing, domain "
"registration, and X.509 certificate services."
msgstr "link:https://gandi.net[Gandi] 提供网站托管、云计算、域名注册和 X.509 证书服务。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3854
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Gandi offers an E-rate discount to all FreeBSD developers.  To streamline "
"the process of getting the discount first set up a Gandi account, fill in "
"the billing information and select the currency.  Then send an email to "
"mailto:non-profit@gandi.net[non-profit@gandi.net] using your `@freebsd.org` "
"mail address, and indicate your Gandi handle."
msgstr "Gandi 为所有 FreeBSD 开发人员提供 E-rate 折扣。为简化折扣申请流程，请先创建 Gandi 账户，填写账单信息并选择货币。然后使用你的 `@freebsd.org` 邮箱地址，向 mailto:non-profit@gandi.net[non-profit@gandi.net] 发送电子邮件，并注明你的 Gandi 用户名。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3856
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`rsync.net`"
msgstr "`rsync.net`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3859
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"https://rsync.net[rsync.net] provides cloud storage for offsite backup that "
"is optimized for UNIX users. Their service runs entirely on FreeBSD and ZFS."
msgstr "link:https://rsync.net[rsync.net] 提供针对 UNIX 用户优化的异地备份云存储服务。其服务完全运行于 FreeBSD 和 ZFS 之上。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3861
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"rsync.net offers a free-forever 500 GB account to FreeBSD developers. Simply "
"sign up at https://www.rsync.net/freebsd.html[https://www.rsync.net/freebsd."
"html] using your `@freebsd.org` address to receive this free account."
msgstr "rsync.net 为 FreeBSD 开发人员提供永久免费使用的 500 GB 账户。只需使用你的 `@freebsd.org` 邮箱地址，在 link:https://www.rsync.net/freebsd.html[https://www.rsync.net/freebsd.html] 注册，即可获得此免费账户。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3863
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`Watchgoose`"
msgstr "`Watchgoose`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3866
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"https://watchgoose.com/[Watchgoose] provides hosted monitoring for cron jobs "
"and backups, as well as other scheduled and recurring tasks that can send a "
"start or completion signal."
msgstr "link:https://watchgoose.com/[Watchgoose] 提供托管监控服务，可监控 cron 作业、备份以及其他能够发送开始或完成信号的定时和周期性任务。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3869
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"FreeBSD committers are eligible for a complimentary paid plan matched to "
"their monitoring needs.  To request access, create a Watchgoose.com account "
"and email mailto:support@watchgoose.com[support@watchgoose.com] from an "
"`@freebsd.org` address, including the email address used (from the FreeBSD."
"org domain) for the Watchgoose account."
msgstr "FreeBSD 提交者有资格获得与其监控需求相匹配的免费付费套餐。如需申请，请创建 Watchgoose.com 账户，然后使用 `@freebsd.org` 邮箱地址向 mailto:support@watchgoose.com[support@watchgoose.com] 发送电子邮件，并注明 Watchgoose 账户所用的邮箱地址（该地址须属于 FreeBSD.org 域名）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/committers-guide/_index.adoc:3870
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"See the https://watchgoose.com/open-source/[Watchgoose Open Source support "
"program] for more information."
msgstr "更多信息请参阅 link:https://watchgoose.com/open-source/[Watchgoose 开源支持计划]。"

